{{Quote|Grants the user a rubber body, immune to electric attacks, and stretchy enough to deal a barrage of offensive attacks.|Shop}}
'''Rubber''' is a {{Rare}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|750,000}} or {{Robux|1,200}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]]. 

The Rubber fruit gives the user a stretchy body, allowing them to extend their limbs to use ranged attacks. Rubber also allows the user to enter into an enhanced state through their '''[V] Transformation''', which makes their attacks instant. Rubber also grants total immunity to [[Guns]] & most attacks infused with electricity.

