==Trivia==
* Prior to [[Updates/20|Update 20]], [[Pole (1st Form)]] could not damage Rubber. 
* Rubber received a rework in [[Updates/17.3|Update 17.3]], upgrading its transformation and renaming it from Gum to the current name.
* Rubber does not provide immunity to the attacks used by the [[Thunder God]], as it is a [[Bosses|boss]].
* The {{Ability|Rubber|Z}} ability has the same name as [[Phoenix]]'s unawakened {{Ability|Phoenix|Z}} ability.
* Despite being immune to [[guns]] and [[Lightning]], Rubber users can still be stunned by the [[Skull Guitar]]'s {{Ability|Skull Guitar|X}} ability and [[Lightning]]'s {{Ability|Lightning|Z}}.

